    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/302a398a513ffd1f9b65ae404763a5dd.avif?t=1745664227\" data-has-big width=800 height=281 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exertion: The Final Stand in a Dystopian Arena</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exertion is a high-octane roguelike side-scroller set in a dystopian future where AI-controlled war machines have seized the battlefield. As a cutting-edge combat robot, you\u2019ll face relentless waves of deadly drones. Survive a treacherous arena filled with turrets, mines, and enemies by pushing your skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>ABILITIES</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to unlock powerful upgrades. Engulf foes in a wall of flames, disrupt their systems with a hack wave, or set a laser trap to outsmart them \u2013 craft your own combat style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/fd2bca18522b87192c58231e03ce0a12.poster.avif?t=1745664227\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/fd2bca18522b87192c58231e03ce0a12.webm?t=1745664227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/fd2bca18522b87192c58231e03ce0a12.mp4?t=1745664227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>CARD SELECTION</u></strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from upgrade cards after each victory. Will you go for devastating firepower, agile maneuvers, or an unbreakable defense? The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/e67e5644aeddb5e21c7a73419e7e2050.poster.avif?t=1745664227\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/e67e5644aeddb5e21c7a73419e7e2050.webm?t=1745664227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/e67e5644aeddb5e21c7a73419e7e2050.mp4?t=1745664227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>BOSS BATTLES</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against massive war machines! Each boss brings unique attack patterns that will test your reflexes and strategies to the max.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/boss.gif?t=1745664227\" width=568 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MORE:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deadly arena packed with turrets, mines, and drones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take down enemies with unique weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger with every run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the demo now and dive into the chaos! Arm yourself with powerful weapons, conquer challenging missions, and upgrade your robot with every battle. Your feedback will shape the future of Exertion. Add it to your wishlist now and claim your place in this dystopian war!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/302a398a513ffd1f9b65ae404763a5dd.avif?t=1745664227\" data-has-big width=800 height=281 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exertion: The Final Stand in a Dystopian Arena</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exertion is a high-octane roguelike side-scroller set in a dystopian future where AI-controlled war machines have seized the battlefield. As a cutting-edge combat robot, you\u2019ll face relentless waves of deadly drones. Survive a treacherous arena filled with turrets, mines, and enemies by pushing your skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>ABILITIES</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to unlock powerful upgrades. Engulf foes in a wall of flames, disrupt their systems with a hack wave, or set a laser trap to outsmart them \u2013 craft your own combat style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/fd2bca18522b87192c58231e03ce0a12.poster.avif?t=1745664227\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/fd2bca18522b87192c58231e03ce0a12.webm?t=1745664227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/fd2bca18522b87192c58231e03ce0a12.mp4?t=1745664227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>CARD SELECTION</u></strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from upgrade cards after each victory. Will you go for devastating firepower, agile maneuvers, or an unbreakable defense? The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/e67e5644aeddb5e21c7a73419e7e2050.poster.avif?t=1745664227\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/e67e5644aeddb5e21c7a73419e7e2050.webm?t=1745664227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/e67e5644aeddb5e21c7a73419e7e2050.mp4?t=1745664227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>BOSS BATTLES</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against massive war machines! Each boss brings unique attack patterns that will test your reflexes and strategies to the max.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164600/extras/boss.gif?t=1745664227\" width=568 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MORE:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deadly arena packed with turrets, mines, and drones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take down enemies with unique weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger with every run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the demo now and dive into the chaos! Arm yourself with powerful weapons, conquer challenging missions, and upgrade your robot with every battle. Your feedback will shape the future of Exertion. Add it to your wishlist now and claim your place in this dystopian war!</p>",
